{"hymn":"S263","parent":"E322","quality":"adapted","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":2},"title":"Una fuente vanamente yo busqué","subtitle":"La certeza y el gozo de la salvación—Satisfechos con Cristo","syl":{"n1":["U","i"],"n2":["na","t"],"n3":["fuen","i"],"n4":["te","t"],"n5":["va","i"],"n6":["na","m"],"n7":["men","m"],"n8":["te","t"],"n9":"yo","n10":["bus","i"],"n11":["qué,","t"],"n12":"Que","n13":"no","n14":["se‿a","i"],"n15":["go","m"],"n16":["ta","m"],"n17":["ra","t"],"n18":"más;","n20":"Lo","n21":"que","n22":["me‿o","i"],"n23":["fre","m"],"n24":["ció","t"],"n25":"la","n26":["tie","i"],"n27":["rra‿i","m"],"n28":["nú","m"],"n29":["til","t"],"n30":"fue,","n31":["Na","i"],"n32":["da","t"],"n33":"me","n34":["pu","i"],"n35":["do","t"],"n36":["sa","i"],"n37":["ciar.","t"],"n39":["Be","i"],"n40":["bo","t"],"n41":"de","n42":"la","n43":["fuen","i"],"n44":["te","t"],"n45":["i","i"],"n46":["na","m"],"n47":["go","m"],"n48":["ta","m"],"n49":["ble‿hoy,","t"],"n50":["Be","i"],"n51":["bo","t"],"n52":"de","n53":"la","n54":["fuen","i"],"n55":["te‿de","t"],"n56":"la","n57":["vi","i"],"n58":["da","t"],"n59":"yo.","n60":["Ha","i"],"n61":["llo‿en","t"],"n62":"gran","n63":["me","i"],"n64":["di","m"],"n65":["da","t"],"n66":["Go","i"],"n67":["zo","t"],"n68":["y‿a","i"],"n69":["le","m"],"n70":["grí","m"],"n71":["a,","t"],"n72":"De","n73":"la","n74":["fuen","i"],"n75":["te","t"],"n76":"de","n77":["la‿vi","i"],"n78":["da","t"],"n79":["be","i"],"n80":["bo","t"],"n81":"yo."},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Por desierto de pecado ya no voy,","Manantial vivo‿encontré;","Y mi copa de‿alegría llena‿está,","Cristo‿es mi Señor y Rey."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Siempre‿encuentro‿aquí descanso y solaz,","Con grande satisfacción;","Al volar los días, hay consuelo‿y paz,","Bendito‿es mi corazón."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Tengo aquí seguro un suplir sin fin,","Por toda la‿eternidad;","A‿esta fuente sanadora acudiré,","Mi alma cansada a lavar."]}]}